[39;49m[K  [38;5;12;49m1. [39;49mThe docs and code disagree on idle termination. [38;5;6;49mStatusIdle[39;49m says it can mean output remained unchanged past the classification threshold in [38;5;6;49mpkg/wrapper/wrapper.go:123[39;49m, and the docs[39m[49m[0m[r[45;3H[43;2H[0m[49m[K[44;2H[0m[48;2;65;69;76m[K[45;22H[0m[48;2;65;69;76m[K[46;2H[0m[48;2;65;69;76m[K[47;50H[0m[49m[K[39m[49m[0m[0 q[?25h[45;3H[?2026l[?2026h[1;42r[42;1H
